  "question": {
    "text": "Let the area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> are coprime numbers. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "119",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, finding the point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> will be, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, plotting the diagramw we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a9bb1e5c-73a3-4182-ae5a-5161f50d003e.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 275px;\"/></p><p>Now, from the above diagram, the required area will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mfrac><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>107</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>119</mn></math></p>",
